<title>USA: Hussey copper price rises to 128 cents May 8.</title>
<headline>Hussey copper price rises to 128 cents May 8.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hussey Copper Ltd said its contained copper price was up one cent at 128.00 cents a lb, effective with shipments of May 8.</p>
<p>--New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1640</p>
</text>
